-- a corporation is listed
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "entity" the body is an entity` (`a corporation`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an unincorporated association is listed
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "entity" the body is an entity` (`an unincorporated association`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a partnership is listed
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "entity" the body is an entity` (`a partnership`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the government of any state is listed
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "entity" the body is an entity` (`the government of a state`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a trust: "but does not include a trust"
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "entity" the body is an entity` (`a trust`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a body the list does not name: "includes" does not close the list
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "entity" the body is an entity` (`some other body`) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (a)(i): the individual's spouse
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`a spouse`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS FALSE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 0, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(i): a stepsister
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`a stepsister`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS FALSE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 0, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(i): a stepfather
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`a stepfather`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS FALSE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 0, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a cousin: not in the list, and "means" closes it
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`some other relation`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS FALSE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 0, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a)(ii): a body in which the individual or a relative controls exactly 20%: "not less than 20%"
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`some other relation`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS TRUE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 20, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(ii): 19% is below 20%
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`some other relation`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS TRUE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 19, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a firm, limited liability partnership or corporation
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "connected person" (a) the person is connected to the individual` WITH `the relation of the person to the individual` IS (`some other relation`), `the person is a firm, a limited liability partnership or a corporation` IS FALSE, `the voting power in that body controlled by the individual or any of those relatives, individually or jointly` IS 50, `the total voting power in that body` IS 100) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b): exactly 20%
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "connected person" (b) the body is connected to the firm, limited liability partnership or corporation` 20 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b): 19%
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "connected person" (b) the body is connected to the firm, limited liability partnership or corporation` 19 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b): 19.99%
#ASSERT `s 2(1) "connected person" (b) the body is connected to the firm, limited liability partnership or corporation` 1999 10000 EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (a)(i): a person on whose behalf the licence holder carries on a regulated activity
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" of a licence holder, for Parts 4, 6, 7 and 15`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(i) has only the "on whose behalf" limb: a principal counterparty is a customer under Part 5 alone
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" of a licence holder, for Parts 4, 6, 7 and 15`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS TRUE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a)(ii)(A): Part 5, on whose behalf
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" of a licence holder, for Part 5`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(ii)(B): Part 5, a person with whom the holder deals as principal
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" of a licence holder, for Part 5`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS TRUE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Part 5: prescribed not to be a customer
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" of a licence holder, for Part 5`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS TRUE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Part 5: neither limb
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" of a licence holder, for Part 5`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b): a person on whose behalf a member carries on an activity regulated under the Act
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" for Part 3 and the definition of user`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b)(i): the member for its own account
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" for Part 3 and the definition of user`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS TRUE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b)(ii): an officer, director, employee or representative of the member
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" for Part 3 and the definition of user`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS TRUE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b)(iii): a related corporation for its own account
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" for Part 3 and the definition of user`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b): nobody on whose behalf a member acts
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" for Part 3 and the definition of user`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- any other provision: the definition gives no meaning there
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "customer" the person is a customer` WITH `the provision being read` IS (`s 2(1) "customer" for any other provision`), `the holder of a capital markets services licence carries on or will carry on a regulated activity on behalf of the person` IS TRUE, `the holder enters or will enter, as principal, into transactions with the person for the sale or purchase of capital markets products` IS FALSE, `the person is one the regulations prescribe not to be a customer for Part 5` IS FALSE, `a member of an approved exchange, approved clearing house, recognised clearing house or recognised market operator carries on an activity regulated under this Act on behalf of the person` IS FALSE, `the person is the member itself, dealing for the member's own account` IS FALSE, `the person is an officer, director, employee or representative of the member` IS FALSE, `the person is a related corporation of the member, in respect of accepted instructions to deal for an account belonging to, and maintained wholly for the benefit of, that related corporation` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- all of the written form and (a) to (e)
#ASSERT (`s 2(1) "franchise" the agreement or arrangement is a franchise` WITH `the agreement or arrangement is in writing and between 2 or more persons` IS TRUE, `the franchisor authorises or permits the franchisee, or a person associated with the franchisee, to engage in the business of offering, selling or distributing goods or services in Singapore under a plan or system controlled by the franchisor or a person associated with the franchisor` IS TRUE, `the business carried on by the franchisee is capable of being identified by the public as substantially associated with a trade or service mark, logo, symbol or name identifying, commonly connected with or controlled by the franchisor` IS TRUE, `the franchisor exerts, or has authority to exert, a significant degree of control over the method or manner of operation of the franchisee's business` IS TRUE, `the franchisee, or a person associated with the franchisee, is required to make payment or give some other form of consideration to the franchisor or a person associated with the franchisor` IS TRUE, `the franchisor agrees to communicate knowledge, experience, expertise, know-how, trade secrets or other information to the franchisee or a person associated with the franchisee` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- one element missing (w): "and" joins them all
